The unnamed '''sportscaster''' (Japanese: ''Announcer'') is a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[SM060|Getting a Jump on the Competition!]]''. He was one of the hosts for the [[Pokémon Sled Jump Games]] on [[Mount Lanakila]], the other being the [[Pokémon Sled Jump master]].

During the games, he introduced all of the contestants, and later [[Cerah]] during her exhibition jump. At the end, he announced that the winner was [[Hala]] and {{p|Crabominable}}.

